  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data-driven multisectoral humanitarian response for vulnerable populations in T&#xfc;rkiyeData-driven multisectoral humanitarian response for vulnerable populations in T&#xfc;rkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More than two years after the devastating earthquakes that struck T&#xfc;rkiye in 2023, the country continue to face significant and complex humanitarian needs. Through this action, IOM is providing critical multisectoral support to displaced populations in T&#xfc;rkiye, through coordinated and evidence-based assistance. In coordination with national and local authorities as well as key humanitarian partners, and inter-agency coordination mechanisms, IOM is providing: i) Water, Sanitation, Hygiene (WASH) services, and ii) multipurpose Cash Assistance (MPCA) services in priority locations identified though Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM) assessments.</narrative>
  </description>
